          "short": "$x=\\frac{-7-\\sqrt{69}}{2}$ or $x=\\frac{-7+\\sqrt{69}}{2}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+7x+\\frac{49}{4}-\\frac{49}{4}-5&=0\\\\x^2+7x+\\frac{49}{4}&=\\frac{69}{4}\\\\\\left(x+\\frac72\\right)^2&=\\frac{69}{4}\\\\x+\\frac72&=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{69}}2\\\\x&=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{69}}2\\end{align*}$$",
